      <h1 class="sr-only" id="page-heading">Shoqëria dhe Mjedisi 4</h1>
      <div id="content" class="container opacity-0"><section data-section-type="boxed_text" data-section-id="pg021_sec002" class="mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-8 max-sm:px-5 py-8"><div class="border-2 border-purple-300 bg-white shadow-sm rounded-sm p-6 max-sm:p-4"><p class="adt-body italic leading-relaxed text-left text-gray-800"><span data-id="pg021_n0017">Jeta jon&#xeb; varet nga kujdesi q&#xeb; tregojm&#xeb; p&#xeb;r sh&#xeb;ndetin.</span> <span data-id="pg021_n0018">P&#xeb;rmes kujdesit sh&#xeb;ndet&#xeb;sor, ne mundohemi t&apos;i parandalojm&#xeb; s&#xeb;mundjet dhe t&apos;i trajtojm&#xeb; m&#xeb; mir&#xeb; n&#xeb;se na shfaqen ato.</span> <span data-id="pg021_n0019">Mjeku kujdeset p&#xeb;r sh&#xeb;ndetin e njer&#xeb;zve, komunikon me pacient&#xeb;t, duke u ofruar sh&#xeb;rbim sh&#xeb;ndet&#xeb;sor t&#xeb; cil&#xeb;sis&#xeb; s&#xeb; lart&#xeb;.</span> <span data-id="pg021_n0020">Mjeku ka misionin human, duke respektuar jet&#xeb;n e njeriut, integritetin dhe dinjitetin e tij.</span> <span data-id="pg021_n0021">Mjeku duhet t&#xeb; ofroj&#xeb; ndihm&#xeb;n mjek&#xeb;sore, t&#xeb; nj&#xeb;jt&#xeb; p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; gjith&#xeb;, pa dallim moshe, gjinie, komb&#xeb;sie, feje, duke respektuar t&#xeb; drejtat e pacientit.</span> <span data-id="pg021_n0022">Ai duhet t&#xeb; p&#xeb;rkujdeset q&#xeb; t&#xeb; s&#xeb;murit t&#xeb; mos i cenohen t&#xeb; drejtat e garantuara me ligj p&#xeb;r sa i p&#xeb;rket sh&#xeb;ndetit t&#xeb; tij.</span></p></div></section></div>
